{"id":"c980af2d105cc55b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-list-decodable-code.md","title":"列表可译码的组合条件","display":"df-list-decodable-code — 列表可译码的组合条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-list-decodable-code","aliases":["28-df-list-decodable-code"],"display":"df-list-decodable-code — 列表可译码的组合条件","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]"],"source_book_location":"§19.5 and Theorem 19.23 list-size formulation","source_printed_pages":"392–393","source_pdf_pages":"418–419","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-list-decodable-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-list-decodable-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-list-decodable-code — 列表可译码的组合条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§19.5 and Theorem 19.23 list-size formulation"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"392–393"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"418–419"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Sigma,n,m,E\">\\(A,\\Sigma,n,m,E\\)</span> 与候选消息集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)\">\\(\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in[0,1]\">\\(\\rho\\in[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(L\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ListDecodable}(E;\\rho,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad |\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ListDecodable}(E;\\rho,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad |\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书“半径内不能有太多码字”的显式谓词缩写；消息列表计数，不包含计算效率承诺。没有正距离或单射时，按消息计数较按不同码字计数强，故保留 E 的消息集合。新节点用于区分组合界和下一项的局部算法。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§19.5 and Theorem 19.23 list-size formulation；印刷页 392–393；PDF 页 418–419。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,\\Sigma,n,m,E$ 与候选消息集合 $\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)$ 采用 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]；$\\rho\\in[0,1]$，$L\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\Sigma,n,m,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ListDecodable}(E;\\rho,L)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad |\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le L.","display":true}],"bytes":1446,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-374","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]、[[28-thm-reed-muller-distance]]、[[28-df-list-decodable-code]]、[[28-df-local-decoder]]、[[28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding]]、[[28-lem-hardcore-distribution]]、[[28-df-local-list-decoder]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b"]}